Z||000000||87 Pegasus||08-13-2001||11:40 PM||||So I was stuck in traffic on I80 (that's in Illinois crossing into Indiana) on my way to Lady Pegasus' when all of a sudden....BAM!!  Not good.  My Fiero wasn't playing nice with a Cutlass.  I found the nose wedged under the bumper.  When I backed up (The Cutlass couldn't go forward....back tires off the ground) what to my wondering eyes should appear than my Fiero logo on the ground (shedding tears).  Take a gander for yourself....if you dare.   Any Donations????  haha <BR><P>------------------<BR>Friends don't let friends drive Corvettes!!||||reg||8
