Z||000005||FieroJoe||08-13-2001||11:54 PM||||Ouch!  and I know what you mean about the I-80 traffic.  A bunch of us were trying to get to the El Paso, IL show and we moved about 2 miles in a hour in that traffic.<P>I would scrap that fascia.  With tears that big, even that flexible bumper repair stuff could still eventually pop right off with too much flex.  The hole left by your emblem popping off would be a bear to try and fill correctly anyways.<P>Good luck reparing your car!||||reg||1
Z||000006||Lady Pegasus||08-13-2001||11:54 PM||||Well Dave, since the "phantom GT" is done, now you can spend your time helping Mike. <BR>B.T.W.-Mike walked away just a tad shaken.  This was his first accident ever.  Again, it was only 5-10 mph, and things could have gotten MUCH worse.  For once....THANK GOD FOR TRAFFIC!!!<P>------------------<BR>Hey pretty....don't you wanna take a ride with me...through my world?||||reg||10
