Z||000012||KissMySSFiero||08-14-2001||01:49 PM||||Mike,<BR>i just got your email.  sorry i couldnt help with parts.  if you just damaged the bumper and the honeycomb and other little parts your lucky.  i have to take mine to a shop to get  fixed.  i T boned an oldsmobile goin about 35.  my brakes locked up in the rain and slid thru an intersection.  It was Florida Ice.  oil on the road and it just started to rain so it all came to the surface.  that was two years ago and im just now able to afford gettin it fixed.  its nice havin a job that pays at least half of what im worth.  =Þ   unfortunatly i wont have it done in time for fierorama.  but my suspension will be.  ill be finishing that tonight.  all new poly, ball joints, shocks and struts, and tires.  i cant wait to drive my car with all the new stuff.  <BR>good luck wht the body work.  see ya at fierorama.||||reg||1
